  "Identifikasi materi KRP & analisis pengaruh KLHS RDTR Kec. Selaawi–Banyuresmi": "Identification of KRP materials & impact analysis of KLHS RDTR Selaawi–Banyuresmi District",
  "Dinas Lingkungan Hidup Kab. Garut": "Environmental Agency of Garut Regency",
  "Penyepakatan isu pembangunan berkelanjutan strategis KLHS RDTR Kec. Selaawi–Banyuresmi": "Agreement on strategic sustainable development issues of KLHS RDTR Selaawi–Banyuresmi District",
  "Perumusan isu pembangunan berkelanjutan paling strategis KLHS RDTR Kec. Selaawi–Banyuresmi": "Formulation of the most strategic sustainable development issues of KLHS RDTR Selaawi–Banyuresmi District",
  "Sangat membantu dalam penyusunan KLHS RDTR di daerah kami. Penjelasannya detail dan mudah dipahami, baik oleh tim teknis maupun pemangku kepentingan non-teknis. Rekomendasi terbaik untuk kajian lingkungan hidup strategis.": "Extremely helpful in preparing KLHS RDTR in our region. Detailed and easy-to-understand explanations for both technical teams and non-technical stakeholders. Highly recommended for strategic environmental assessments.",
  "Profesional dan responsif sejak konsultasi awal. Hasil pemodelan sistem dinamiknya sangat membantu pengambilan keputusan di daerah kami.": "Professional and responsive from initial consultation. The system dynamics modeling results greatly helped our regional decision-making.",
  "Kompeten di bidangnya dan komunikasi lancar selama proyek berjalan. Hanya perlu sedikit penyesuaian jadwal di tahap awal.": "Competent in their field with smooth communication throughout the project. Just needed minor schedule adjustments initially.",
